I come back from the café on Saturday morning.
I open the door to my flat.
Moti is waiting for me near the door.
He is very happy to see me.
He suddenly runs outside past me!
He goes quickly into the hallway.
I get scared and say loudly, "Moti, stop!"
"Don't go there, come here quickly!"
He does not listen to me and goes further.
I pick up his red ball from inside the flat.
I show the ball to him and say, "Moti, look at this!"
"Come on, come here!"
"Catch this."
He sees the ball and comes running to me.
I quickly bring him inside.
I immediately close the door.
I explain to him lovingly, "Moti, don't do that."
"You must stay inside the house."
"Going outside alone is strictly forbidden."
